    "category" : "CodeStyle",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Avoid Using \"goto\" Statement",
    "description" : "This rule discourages the use of the 'goto' statement in code.",
    "explanation" : "## Why is this an issue?\n\n`goto` is an unstructured control flow statement. It makes code less readable and maintainable. Structured control flow statements such\nas `if`, `for`, `while`, `continue` or `break` should be used instead.",
    "enabled" : false,
    "timeToFix" : 3,
    "parameters" : [
